{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國天團BIGBANG為慶祝出道20周年，近日來港唱爆啟德，吸引數以萬計歌迷捧場，藝人李蔓瑩亦有入場朝聖。</p><p>她昨日（16日）在社交網一口氣晒出多張場內照及精華片段，興奮表示：「Welcome back！</p><p>HAPPY 20th ANNIVERSA</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:12:06.263830+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T10:01:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:25.270990+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:05:25.270990+00:00","content_hash":"47f5d58f8b92326a27605c1621ce25cdb98bd50e0e01aa4a49fdbdd263f3a16c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}